    "reviews": "\u201cAdorable hidden-object game that offers bite-size challenges and encourages players to express their creativity through the main levels and the sandbox mode\u201d<br>5 / 5 \u2013 Thumb Culture<br><br>\u201cHidden in My Paradise is one of the best hidden object games I've played; it's charming visually and gameplay-wise. A lot of love and thought went into it, and it's evident.\u201d<br>9 \u2013 GameGrin<br>",
